== Trivia ==
*Despite the mention of a discount, buying a {{Item|Plumber's Sponge}} via the Abiphone Contact still costs the same as the usual price.
*Prior to the 0.19.9 update, business hours were based on the actual in-game time, and {{Item|Day Saver}} and {{Item|Night Saver}} had no effect on it. However, since the addition of the Island Time menu, setting your {{zone|Private Island}} or {{zone|The Garden}} to day permanently allows you to call Plumber Joe anytime.

